flowchart TD
    A[Client Request] --> B[Rate Limiter]
    B -->|429| Z1[Rejected]
    B --> C[Input DLP Scan + Redact]
    C --> D[Prompt-Injection Detection]
    D --> E{Input Policy Decision}
    E -->|BLOCK| Z2[Rejected, reasons returned]
    E -->|FLAG or ALLOW| F[LLM Backend Call]
    F --> G[Output DLP Scan + Redact]
    G --> H[Output Leak / Canary Detection]
    H --> I{Output Policy Decision}
    I -->|BLOCK| Z3[Response withheld]
    I -->|ALLOW| J[Response to Client]
    C -.-> K[(Audit Log - hash chained)]
    D -.-> K
    E -.-> K
    G -.-> K
    H -.-> K
    I -.-> K
